  "constraints": [
    "Operations Landscape is a governed declaration and reproducible projection, while Supply Network is a scoped graph view; neither mints subject identity.",
    "Product, design, BOM, serialized item, stock position, movement, shipment, trace, work order, order and fulfilment retain separate mastership.",
